### Topic 34 - Validation
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. VALID registration -> 201 Created
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha Rao",
  "email": "asha@example.com",
  "password": "Secret@123",
  "phone": "+91 98765 43210",
  "age": 25,
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-05-21",
  "address": { "street": "MG Road 1", "city": "Bengaluru", "pinCode": "560001" },
  "interests": ["java", "music"]
}

### 2. INVALID registration -> 400 Bad Request with 9 errors
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "weak",
  "phone": "12345",
  "age": 15,
  "dateOfBirth": "2090-01-01",
  "address": { "street": "", "city": "Pune", "pinCode": "12" },
  "interests": ["", "x"]
}

### 3. Missing fields completely -> @NotBlank / @NotNull errors
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4. Path variable validation: @Min(1) -> 400
GET {{base}}/users/0

### 5. Path variable OK -> 200 (after request 1) or 404
GET {{base}}/users/1

### 6. Query parameter validation: @Size(min = 2) -> 400
GET {{base}}/users/search?name=a

### 7. Query parameter OK
GET {{base}}/users/search?name=as

### 8. VALID booking -> 201
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventName": "Spring Conf", "eventDate": "2030-01-15", "seats": 2, "discountPercent": 10, "pricePerSeat": 499.00 }

### 9. INVALID booking: past date, 0 seats, 80% discount, price 0 -> 400
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventName": "", "eventDate": "2020-01-15", "seats": 0, "discountPercent": 80, "pricePerSeat": 0 }

### 10. Validation GROUP OnCreate: sending an id is NOT allowed -> 400
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 5, "name": "Pen", "price": 10 }

### 11. Group OnCreate OK -> 201
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Pen", "price": 10 }

### 12. Group OnUpdate: id is REQUIRED (and Default rules still run: name blank) -> 400
PUT {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "price": 10 }

### 13. Group OnUpdate OK -> 200
PUT {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 5, "name": "Blue Pen", "price": 12 }
